### Verification artefacts ###
# tools/verify.py copies a server jar into a throwaway world for each run, and the
# pre-flood chunk exports are hundreds of megabytes. Neither belongs in the repo,
# and a Minecraft server jar is not redistributable in any case.
tools/run_*/
tools/geom_*/
tools/proto_*/
